{title: 173 - Good Christian Friends, Rejoice!}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #173 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 173}
{meta: category Jesus Christ - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[C]Good [G]Christian [C]friends, [Em]rejoice [F]and [Dm]sing!
[Am]Now [G/B]is [Am/C]the [G]triumph [C]of our [F]King!
[Dm]To [Em]all [Dm/F]the [C]world glad news [G]we [Am]bring:
[Am]Alleluia! [Dm]Alleluia! Alleluia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[C]The [G]Lord [Am]of [C]life [Dm]is [Em]risen [F]for [Dm]aye;
[Am]Bring flowers of [G]song [C]to strew [F]His [Em]way;
[Dm]Let [Em]all [Dm/F]mankind [C]rejoice [G]and [Am]say:
[Am]Alleluia! [Dm]Alleluia! Alleluia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[C]Praise [G]we [Em]in [C]songs [Em]of [C]victory
[Am]That [G/B]love, [Am/C]that [G]life [C]which cannot [Em]die,
[Dm]And [Em]sing [Dm/F]with [C]hearts uplifted [Am]high:
[Am]Alleluia! [Dm]Alleluia! Alleluia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[C]Thy [G]name [Em]we [C]bless, [Em]O [C]risen [Dm]Lord,
[Am]And [G/B]sing [Am/C]today [C]with one [F]accord
[Dm]The [Em]life [Dm/F]laid [C]down, the life [G]restored:
[Am]Alleluia! [Dm]Alleluia! Alleluia!
{end_of_verse}
